# ─── Claude Code local settings (machine-specific, never tracked) ─────────────
# settings.local.json is the per-developer override file and routinely
# contains machine-specific absolute paths (it did — that's how .claude/ ended
# up leaking a personal path to the public remote on 2026-09-13, see
# CLAUDE.md's "Public Repo / Git Hygiene Rules" section and DECISIONS.md's
# "Public Repo Hardening" entry). settings.json is project-level hook config,
# also kept local by convention. Everything else under .claude/ (CLAUDE.md,
# DECISIONS.md, PHASE_STATUS.md, QUICK_REF.md, SCRATCH.md, skills/) IS
# tracked — it holds no personal paths and documents real project history.
# Before ever adding a new file under .claude/ to git, re-scan it for
# absolute local paths first.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

